cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "OpenPWR: a non-linear PWR plant model with a two-point axial core and a control testbed"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chung
    given-names: Nikolas
  - family-names: Evripidou
    given-names: Christos
  - family-names: Mercangöz
    given-names: Mehmet
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/nikchung51327/OpenPWR"
abstract: >-
  A non-linear pressurised water reactor plant model: Li's two-point axial
  core (point kinetics and iodine/xenon per axial half) in Vajpayee's plant,
  with a closed-loop control testbed for continuous and sampled controllers.
keywords:
  - nuclear engineering
  - pressurised water reactor
  - load following
  - axial offset control
  - process control
